"source": "U.S. Census Bureau, National Population Estimates by single year of age and sex (both sexes). 1975-1979: 'Resident Population plus Armed Forces Overseas', pe-11 tables (www2.census.gov/programs-surveys/popest/tables/1900-1980/national/asrh/pe-11-YYYY.csv, July 1). 1980-1989: quarterly intercensal eXXYYrqi files (www2.census.gov/programs-surveys/popest/datasets/1980-1990/national/asrh/, July estimate). 1990-1999: us-est90int-07.csv (July 1). 2000-2009: us-est00int-alldata.csv (July, MONTH=7). 2010-2019: nc-est2020-agesex-res.csv (POPESTIMATE, July 1). 2020-2024: nc-est2024-agesex-res.csv (POPESTIMATE, July 1).",
